{
 "_readme": "The key skeleton of the site's two Multi-turn sample files (patientwords branch claude/multiturn-tab at 771ebb0aee4b0e7603967528154df7142e680820, PR #9: data/petri_multiturn_summary.sample.json and data/petri_multiturn_conversations.sample.json), the shapes multi-turn/index.html reads. Each path maps to the keys its objects carry, in the samples' order (the union over every object at that path), or to '*' for an open map whose keys are data (scenario ids, mechanism ids, measure ids, rule field names). seeds[].swaps is not descended: the page never reads it and the samples carry null. tests/test_export_petri_multiturn.py holds the exporter's output to this skeleton. Regenerate it from the site's samples when the page's reads change.",
